    "detailed_description": "<h1>DISCORD SERVER</h1><p>Join the discord community and get involved in the game's development!<br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2070920/extras/a91892ef09b2543ff5533d28ed146510.poster.avif?t=1682809746\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2070920/extras/a91892ef09b2543ff5533d28ed146510.webm?t=1682809746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2070920/extras/a91892ef09b2543ff5533d28ed146510.mp4?t=1682809746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Survive through waves of enemies by cutting through and eliminating all virus enemies. <br>Prevent drowning in the swarm of evil robots. Once destroyed, your doll will be restored in the home base as you challenge again.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CHOOSE YOUR UPGRADES</h2>Three selections every wave completed to help you progress through the game.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2070920/extras/f9569e2e403d0f7ae1bd1542269247e0.poster.avif?t=1682809746\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2070920/extras/f9569e2e403d0f7ae1bd1542269247e0.webm?t=1682809746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2070920/extras/f9569e2e403d0f7ae1bd1542269247e0.mp4?t=1682809746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fast-paced hack and slash action gameplays.<br></li><li>Choose your character builds to assist you in the playthrough.<br></li><li>Ultimate Skill to trigger cinematic large-scale attacks.<br></li><li>Online Co-op up to 4 players!<br></li><li>Choose between different characters with different playstyles. (IN-DEVELOPMENT)<br></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DOLLS OF MACHINA</h2><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2070920/extras/9065aef127ef15e784110b6fb0b8d3c4.avif?t=1682809746\" /></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2070920/extras/a91892ef09b2543ff5533d28ed146510.poster.avif?t=1682809746\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2070920/extras/a91892ef09b2543ff5533d28ed146510.webm?t=1682809746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2070920/extras/a91892ef09b2543ff5533d28ed146510.mp4?t=1682809746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Survive through waves of enemies by cutting through and eliminating all virus enemies. <br>Prevent drowning in the swarm of evil robots. Once destroyed, your doll will be restored in the home base as you challenge again.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CHOOSE YOUR UPGRADES</h2>Three selections every wave completed to help you progress through the game.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2070920/extras/f9569e2e403d0f7ae1bd1542269247e0.poster.avif?t=1682809746\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2070920/extras/f9569e2e403d0f7ae1bd1542269247e0.webm?t=1682809746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2070920/extras/f9569e2e403d0f7ae1bd1542269247e0.mp4?t=1682809746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fast-paced hack and slash action gameplays.<br></li><li>Choose your character builds to assist you in the playthrough.<br></li><li>Ultimate Skill to trigger cinematic large-scale attacks.<br></li><li>Online Co-op up to 4 players!<br></li><li>Choose between different characters with different playstyles. (IN-DEVELOPMENT)<br></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DOLLS OF MACHINA</h2>